    "body": "## Description\n\nAdd standard `--version`/`-v` and `--help`/`-h` command-line options before GTK startup.\n\nFixes #26\n\n## Changes\n\n- Print `HoneyBee Browser v0.1.0` and exit successfully for `--version` and `-v`.\n- Print a concise usage message with the browser name, description, and both options for `--help` and `-h`.\n- Preserve the existing GTK startup path for all other arguments.\n\n## Type of Change\n\n- [x] New feature\n- [ ] Bug fix\n- [ ] Documentation update\n- [ ] Refactor\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] I have read the CONTRIBUTING.md guide.\n- [x] My code follows the project's coding standards.\n- [ ] I have added tests that prove my fix is effective or that my feature works.\n- [ ] I have updated the documentation accordingly.\n- [ ] All new and existing tests pass.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `git diff --check` — passed.\n- `cmake -S . -B build -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Debug` — not runnable in this environment because CMake is unavailable.\n- `pkg-config --exists gtkmm-4.0` — GTKmm development dependency is unavailable locally.\n",
